# Kind $68's test for Aladdin standing on it (Kind68PlayerOn, $83:E90D):
# the two parts no play reaches. The play of rand_stage_a3_s2 (seed 7) to
# frame 200, Aladdin on the climb's platforms; then:
# - $141B poked to 1 ($0367 is nonzero throughout): his feet are taken 32
#   below his y rather than 37 ($83:E993);
# - the shape ($47) of the three flat platforms (records $0E7B, $0ECB and
#   $0FBB) poked to 1: the one he is on has its top by the slope
#   ($83:E9B3).
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a3_s2.state
hold Y+RIGHT 23
hold RIGHT 13
hold LEFT 50
hold DOWN+A 31
hold B+R 57
hold RIGHT 26
poke 00141B 01
poke 000EC2 01
poke 000F12 01
poke 001002 01
wait 120
